# Git safety (permanent)

- Never push to GitHub unless the user explicitly asks (e.g. 「上传」「推送」「上传到 github」).
- If asked to push, confirm the remote/URL and branch first. Default repo: `https://github.com/nexloveie-ops/LZfood`.
- Never rollback / hard reset / revert unless the user gives an explicit instruction **and** you confirm the exact command and impact first.
- Large risky refactors: take a local backup first when the user asks (e.g. `backup_*` folders).
- Prefer discussion when the user says 「不写代码 / 只讨论」; implement only after 「ok go / 实现 / 修改代码」.
